      "value": "We're aware of this feature and are also quite excited to get it into VRChat, but it needs a pretty hefty security review, especially if we plan on putting it on avatars. We've also got to ensure it doesn't step on the toes of our various systems-- we need to test it, a lot.\n\nIn short, planned status? Soon™? But we're not on it just yet because we're trying to get the whole 2017 upgrade sorted out before we work in new features.",
