  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Unity 2017 has some great new features for animators like my self.\nMost of all the Timeline feature.\nIn short the unity time line allows you to:\n*create, play, and edit multiple animations on multiple characters and objects at the same time.\n*edit audio clips together for your sequence.\n*make more complex particle effects.\n\nBasically Timeline is just like the timeline in a video editing software, but instead of editing audio and video your editing audio and animations.\n\nThis is a really powerful tool for people who like to make big animations on there avatars and/or maps.\nAnd this feature would make the lives of many content creators so much easier.\n\nI believe the addition of this wonderful feature to vrchat will open the door for many more content creators to start making these big beautiful animations.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/TimelineOverview.html\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G_uBFM3YUF4",
